  // surface). Falls back to the tessellated points (faceted) only when no control points were captured.
  // S127：B 样条系【逼近型】（曲线唔过控制点）→ 唔可以送 ctrl（内核会 smoothSplineTo 穿过控制点 = 完全唔同形）。
